@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F6F7F8
skinparam stateBorderColor #222222
skinparam stateArrowColor #3D8DFF

[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Configured : products and pricing complete
Configured --> Validated : policy and data checks pass
Validated --> PendingApproval : approval required
Validated --> Approved : no approval required
PendingApproval --> Approved : all required steps approved
PendingApproval --> Rejected : any terminal rejection
PendingApproval --> Recalled : submitter recalls
Rejected --> Draft : revise quote
Recalled --> Draft : revise quote
Approved --> ProposalGenerated : generate document
ProposalGenerated --> Accepted : customer accepts / signs
ProposalGenerated --> Draft : controlled amendment
Accepted --> Contracted : contract created and reconciled
Contracted --> Ordered : downstream order accepted
Ordered --> Activated : billing and service activation confirmed
Activated --> Amended : approved change
Amended --> PendingApproval : material commercial change
Activated --> Renewed : renewal accepted
Activated --> Expired : end date reached
Renewed --> Activated
Expired --> [*]
@enduml
